  "fixture_basis": "P(fixture) is the synthetic tree plus the fictional objects in parity.supplement(), run through parity.project(), a STAND-IN for the redaction projection (private flag and holds only). The parity claim is only as strong as that stand-in. Regenerate the golden with make_legacy_golden.py once projection-py exists and replaces it.",
  "manifest_order": "place/index.json and media/index.json: the live ETL lists entries in set-iteration order, which depends on PYTHONHASHSEED. make_legacy_golden.py pins the legacy run's order to (grampsId, handle), the order the renderer sorts by, so these two manifests match BY CONSTRUCTION, not by independent parity. The renderer's order is the deliberate one; the live ETL has none. person/index.json and the search-index files are ordered the same way on both sides.",
